\section Solver_intro_files Source files

| File | Content |
|---|---|
| core/solver.cpp | CVODE driver and main() |
| core/parameters.h | the struct Parameters and the parser of the parameter file |
| core/rate_equations.h | declarations of the right-hand-side callbacks and of UserData |
| core/rhs_dispatch.cpp | preconditioner entry points, Jacobi and Woodbury preconditioners |
| core/sparse_jacobian.cpp | colored finite-difference sparse Jacobian for KLU |
| materials/eurofer97/rate_kernels.cpp | EUROFER-97 kernel arithmetic: rhs_full_CD() and rhs_bin_moment() |

All paths are relative to radcluster_code/cpp_utils.

\sa \ref Core_intro, \ref Materials_eurofer97

*/
